<text id="02-output-contract" title="Roadmap Design Output Contract" version="1.0.0" est_tokens="900" depth="essential">
  <summary>JSON Schema (draft-07) for the artefact this methodology produces, plus one valid and one invalid example, and a closed list of forbidden patterns the validator must reject.</summary>

  <section title="JSON Schema">
    <code lang="json"><![CDATA[
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://faion.net/schemas/roadmap-design.json",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "artefact_id",
    "version",
    "last_reviewed",
    "horizon_quarters",
    "uncertainty",
    "format",
    "horizons",
    "external_themes",
    "not_doing",
    "confidence_rubric",
    "review_cadence",
    "audience",
    "owner"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "artefact_id": { "type": "string" },
    "version": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+$" },
    "last_reviewed": { "type": "string", "format": "date" },
    "horizon_quarters": { "type": "integer" },
    "uncertainty": { "enum": ["low", "medium", "high"] },
    "format": { "enum": ["timeline", "now-next-later", "outcome-themed", "kanban"] },
    "horizons": { "type": "array" },
    "external_themes": { "type": "array" },
    "not_doing": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1 },
    "confidence_rubric": { "type": "object" },
    "review_cadence": { "type": "string" },
    "audience": { "type": "string" },
    "owner": { "type": "string" }
  }
}
]]></code>
    <p>`horizons` is the internal source-of-truth row set (r7); `external_themes` is the derived external view, which is why r8 forbids metric targets inside it. `format` is the output of r6.</p>
  </section>

  <section title="Forbidden patterns">
    <list>
            <pattern id="f1">missing any required field — violates r1-outcome-not-feature</pattern>
      <pattern id="f2">owner == &apos;team&apos; / &apos;we&apos; / &apos;&apos; / null</pattern>
      <pattern id="f3">version not semver MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</pattern>
      <pattern id="f4">not_doing absent or empty — violates r10-not-doing-list</pattern>
      <pattern id="f5">a numeric metric target inside external_themes — violates r8-no-external-metric-targets (rule-level check, not machine-enforced)</pattern>
    </list>
  </section>

  <example valid="true">
    <code lang="json"><![CDATA[
{
  "artefact_id": "roadmap-design-example",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "last_reviewed": "2026-05-23",
  "horizon_quarters": 3,
  "uncertainty": "medium",
  "format": "now-next-later",
  "horizons": [
    "item-1",
    "item-2",
    "item-3"
  ],
  "external_themes": [
    "item-1",
    "item-2",
    "item-3"
  ],
  "not_doing": [
    "item-1",
    "item-2",
    "item-3"
  ],
  "confidence_rubric": {
    "key": "value"
  },
  "review_cadence": "review_cadence value",
  "audience": "audience value",
  "owner": "@solo-founder"
}
]]></code>
    <note>Minimum viable conformant output — every required field present, no forbidden pattern matched.</note>
  </example>

  <example valid="false">
    <code lang="json"><![CDATA[
{
  "version": "not-semver"
}
]]></code>
    <note>Invalid — required fields missing or forbidden patterns matched (e.g. semver violation).</note>
  </example>

  <reference path="scripts/validate-roadmap-design.py">Schema validator (stdlib only).</reference>
</text>
